#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:5 14ce1e15cf404d1da95c32dce3b87b08
msgid "Setting Motor Range"
msgstr "设置电机范围"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:7 74b42e746c9b4539b53af995f15d8d27
msgid ""
"Most ESCs have a dead zone at the bottom of their range.  This page outlines"
" how to test the size of the range and then set the spin-when-armed and min "
"throttle values appropriately."
msgstr "大多数ESC在其范围底部存在死区。本页面介绍如何测试死区大小，并相应设置解锁时转速和最小油门值。"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:9 056350f9a3c3464fae0d1e94f6135714
msgid ""
"Although not required, advanced users may wish to take the next step by "
"measuring and adjusting the :ref:`motor thrust curve <motor-thrust-"
"scaling>`."
msgstr "虽然不是必须的，但高级用户可以通过测量和调整 :ref:`电机推力曲线 <motor-thrust-scaling>` 进一步优化。"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:13 5246717162424e02a28ad65620524d71
msgid ""
"Please complete the :ref:`ESC calibration <esc-calibration>` before setting "
"the motor range"
msgstr "设置电机范围前，请先完成 :ref:`ESC校准 <esc-calibration>`"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:16 63a0b17a7aca43e6bcb6b16f96147b2d
msgid "Measuring the deadzone"
msgstr "测量死区"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:18 cea7fb099b174dd9a7448898890b2603
msgid "Remove the propellers from the vehicle"
msgstr "从飞行器上拆下螺旋桨"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:19 6c74b396a4864cdca417a0c9ceba94b3
msgid "Connect the LiPo battery"
msgstr "连接LiPo电池"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:20 058ba1d8b7f04e85bf4fe6291760b8e3
msgid ""
"Connect the autopilot to the Mission Planner using a USB cable or telemetry"
msgstr "通过USB线缆或数传将飞控连接到 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:21 c04c15947edd4662bf969b36e0835607
msgid ""
"Open the Mission Planner's Initial Setup >> Optional Hardware >> Motor Test "
"page"
msgstr ""
"打开 Mission Planner 的Initial Setup >> Optional Hardware >> Motor Test页面"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:26 d88c5e2c310e4133bdb02328405ae92b
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Increase the \"Throttle %\" field and push each of the \"Test motor\" "
"buttons to determine what percentage is required for each of the motors to "
"spin.  If all ESCs are from the same manufacturer they will likely all have "
"similar dead zones, but having one or two different by 1% ~ 2% is common.  "
"Pick the highest percentage of all the motors - we will use this below."
msgstr ""
"增大\"Throttle %\"字段并点击每个\"Test "
"motor\"按钮，确定各电机开始旋转所需的百分比。如果所有ESC来自同一厂家，其死区通常相似，但一两个相差1%~2%的情况很常见。选取所有电机中最高的百分比——下面将用到它。"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:29 b1f5251c0ad349f1981df310229b47f0
msgid "Setting Spin-Armed and Min Throttle"
msgstr "设置解锁转速和最小油门"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:31 2bc708dac01f476a9acb91594dc85423
msgid ""
"By default, when the vehicle is armed but not flying, the motors will spin "
"at a slightly slower than normal speed.  This speed can be configured using "
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` parameter (For older versions check "
"MOT_SPIN_ARMED). Once the vehicle is flying, we want to ensure that we never"
" output a value that causes the motors to stop spinning, this lower limit "
"can be configured :ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN<MOT_SPIN_MIN>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，飞行器解锁但未飞行时，电机将以略低于正常速度旋转。此速度可通过 :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` "
"参数进行配置（旧版本请查看MOT_SPIN_ARMED）。飞行中为确保电机不停转，可通过 "
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN<MOT_SPIN_MIN>` 参数配置下限。"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:34 08c4b244af46400991de4194b0dc7fcd
msgid ""
"set the :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` parameter to **(the percentage "
"discovered above + 2%) / 100**.  I.e. if you found the deadzone of the ESCs "
"was 7%, set :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` to 0.09 (i.e (7 + 2) / 100)."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` 参数设置为 **（上面测到的百分比 + 2%）/ "
"100**。例如，若ESC死区为7%，则将 :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` 设为0.09（即（7 + 2）/ "
"100）。"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:35 997b278e60784b2ab3a95ec8108b1366
msgid ""
"set the :ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>` parameter to at least 0.03 higher"
" than :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>`.  I.e. if :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM "
"<MOT_SPIN_ARM>` was 0.09, set :ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>` to 0.12."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>` 参数设置为至少比 :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM "
"<MOT_SPIN_ARM>` 高0.03。例如，若 :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` 为0.09，则将 "
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>` 设为0.12。"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:39 db3f4d7fa99e4d95883b54c2f579b940
msgid ""
"Setting :ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>` even higher than recommended "
"above is acceptable if we want to account for voltage drop of the battery, "
"but setting it too high reduces the lower range of the motors which reduces "
"control which could be important, especially on powerful copters with a low "
"hover throttle."
msgstr ""
"如果希望考虑电池电压下降的因素，可以将 :ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>` "
"设置得比上述建议值更高，但设置过高会减小电机的低端范围，降低控制性能，这在悬停油门较低的高性能飞行器上尤为重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:43 7d352bed88e34e6888f79f085c59dbe2
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The :ref:`MOT_SPIN_MAX <MOT_SPIN_MAX>` parameter to account for the very top"
" of the ESC/motor range which generally produces no additional thrust.  By "
"default this value is 0.95 (i.e. top 5% of the range produces no additional "
"thrust)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MAX <MOT_SPIN_MAX>` "
"参数用于考虑ESC/电机范围顶端通常不产生额外推力的区域。默认值为0.95（即范围顶部5%不产生额外推力）。"

#: ../../source/docs/set-motor-range.rst:45 99fe87b9a2af44059b953931708c1a6d
msgid ""
"if ESC RPM telemetry is being used, the :ref:`TKOFF_RPM_MIN<TKOFF_RPM_MIN>` "
"parameter could be set slightly below the :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>`"
" parameter to prevent takeoff attempts, and subsequent flips on takeoff, if "
"one or more motors are not spinning."
msgstr ""
"如果使用ESC RPM数传，可将 :ref:`TKOFF_RPM_MIN<TKOFF_RPM_MIN>` 参数设置为略低于 "
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` 参数的值，以防止在一个或多个电机未旋转时尝试起飞，从而避免起飞时的翻转。"
